    "end": 253.48152083333332,
    "file": "voices/025_00_kael_cae1d8f11b78ac50.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 25,
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "text": "He had no spell. He had a choice.",
    "start": 255.681,
    "end": 257.72795833333333,
    "file": "voices/025_01_narrator_4df67d230be19b4c.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.77,
      "speed": 1.03,
      "gain": 0.96
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 26,
    "speaker": "mira",
    "text": "I can steady it, but I cannot carry the whole beam.",
    "start": 260.2,
    "end": 263.15535416666665,
    "file": "voices/026_00_mira_81f68ad23ab737cd.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.04,
      "gain": 0.92
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 26,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "Then steady it. I will do the lifting.",
    "start": 264.65,
    "end": 266.57399999999996,
    "file": "voices/026_01_kael_eacf666bebdac6f2.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 27,
    "speaker": "riven",
    "text": "You got them out? Good. Now get yourself out!",
    "start": 270.2,
    "end": 272.5165416666667,
    "file": "voices/027_00_riven_1e6b934ce14eddb6.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.91,
      "speed": 1.12,
      "gain": 0.98
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 27,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "Not while you are still standing here alone.",
    "start": 274.65,
    "end": 276.78875,
    "file": "voices/027_01_kael_7aac4aa24442514a.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 28,
    "speaker": "riven",
    "text": "Kael, you cannot block that!",
    "start": 280.2,
    "end": 281.64741666666663,
    "file": "voices/028_00_riven_b12d249611c02b2b.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.91,
      "speed": 1.12,
      "gain": 0.98
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 28,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "I know. But I can make it look at me.",
    "start": 284.65,
    "end": 286.7456041666666,
    "file": "voices/028_01_kael_482deb0905c34d8b.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 29,
    "speaker": "mira",
    "text": "Kael! Stay with us!",
    "start": 290.2,
    "end": 291.2537708333333,
    "file": "voices/029_00_mira_9b548d7c76a2c4b6.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.04,
      "gain": 0.92
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 29,
    "speaker": "ancient",
    "text": "At last. A hand without a name, at the door without a key.",
    "start": 294.65,
    "end": 298.32068749999996,
    "file": "voices/029_01_ancient_65ddc3b652363ff6.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.64,
      "speed": 0.95,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 30,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "Who is there? Why can I see lines inside everything?",
    "start": 300.2,
    "end": 302.9714375,
    "file": "voices/030_00_kael_b25efe59fb040721.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 30,
    "speaker": "ancient",
    "text": "Because you are listening beneath the signatures, not above them.",
    "start": 304.65,
    "end": 308.41362499999997,
    "file": "voices/030_01_ancient_9eed877c170b8d5e.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.64,
      "speed": 0.95,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 31,
    "speaker": "ancient",
    "text": "Your mother did not leave you powerless. She hid your beginning from those who would claim it.",
    "start": 310.2,
    "end": 315.5389375,
    "file": "voices/031_00_ancient_54a74dbf05846659.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.64,
      "speed": 0.95,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 31,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "She was protecting me?",
    "start": 316.772,
    "end": 318.0027083333333,
    "file": "voices/031_01_kael_9dd5cfd8d6f64d95.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 32,
    "speaker": "ancient",
    "text": "Origin Weaving changes what magic connects. Every new connection asks something of its maker.",
    "start": 320.2,
    "end": 325.561,
    "file": "voices/032_00_ancient_a6e7e3c382cb1260.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.64,
      "speed": 0.95,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 32,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "What does it ask?",
    "start": 325.681,
    "end": 326.70237499999996,
    "file": "voices/032_01_kael_66b64eb8f4358601.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 33,
    "speaker": "ancient",
    "text": "A memory. A promise. Perhaps a name. Open the first seal, and I will lend you a beginning.",
    "start": 330.2,
    "end": 335.5900625,
    "file": "voices/033_00_ancient_41f575f7152f1181.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.64,
      "speed": 0.95,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 33,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "No stolen lives?",
    "start": 337.135,
    "end": 338.1363333333333,
    "file": "voices/033_01_kael_17fd64b36d530c2b.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 34,
    "speaker": "ancient",
    "text": "Only what you choose to weave. Only what you agree to pay.",
    "start": 340.2,
    "end": 343.773625,
    "file": "voices/034_00_ancient_817a0a8437ea0b5a.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.64,
      "speed": 0.95,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 34,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "Then I choose one chance to help them.",
    "start": 344.954,
    "end": 346.89214583333336,
    "file": "voices/034_01_kael_c06299f9ba6d2428.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 35,
    "speaker": "mira",
    "text": "You are standing. How are you standing?",
    "start": 350.2,
    "end": 352.2785,
    "file": "voices/035_00_mira_346d20c2e0adc078.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.04,
      "gain": 0.92
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 35,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "Mira, keep your thread on the bracket. I can see where it wants to go.",
    "start": 352.985,
    "end": 356.676625,
    "file": "voices/035_01_kael_4828d142f66e0428.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 36,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "Not stronger. Connected differently. The foundation can hold what your hand cannot.",
    "start": 360.2,
    "end": 364.834,
    "file": "voices/036_00_kael_6d6f1d13b2a3eb2e.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 36,
    "speaker": "mira",
    "text": "Then show me the connection.",
    "start": 364.954,
    "end": 366.3387916666667,
    "file": "voices/036_01_mira_89d3609dd2c715c0.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.04,
      "gain": 0.92
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 37,
    "speaker": "riven",
    "text": "Your hand, Kael. That is definitely not nothing.",
    "start": 370.2,
    "end": 372.796875,
    "file": "voices/037_00_riven_997e97b085627dfb.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.91,
      "speed": 1.12,
      "gain": 0.98
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 37,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "There was a song I used to know. Why can't I remember it?",
    "start": 374.65,
    "end": 377.78175,
    "file": "voices/037_01_kael_86d6b9255e2741c5.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 38,
    "speaker": "mira",
    "text": "We discuss the price later. It opens around a direct strike, remember?",
    "start": 380.2,
    "end": 384.09960416666667,
    "file": "voices/038_00_mira_1fb40c44ffda9fb3.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.04,
      "gain": 0.92
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 38,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "Then we stop striking directly.",
    "start": 384.954,
    "end": 386.7198333333333,
    "file": "voices/038_01_kael_cf21f58da761b76c.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 39,
    "speaker": "riven",
    "text": "Tell me where to put the lightning, and please say somewhere sensible.",
    "start": 390.2,
    "end": 393.2732291666667,
    "file": "voices/039_00_riven_8151d923b49d037e.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.91,
      "speed": 1.12,
      "gain": 0.98
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 39,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "The ground. I will give it a path.",
    "start": 394.954,
    "end": 396.727625,
    "file": "voices/039_01_kael_a998ff9bfc4ac486.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 40,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "I lost it. The lines keep moving!",
    "start": 400.2,
    "end": 402.1951041666667,
    "file": "voices/040_00_kael_0f41aa3b5af91c69.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 40,
    "speaker": "mira",
    "text": "So do we. Follow the motion instead of forcing it to stop.",
    "start": 404.65,
    "end": 407.84841666666665,
    "file": "voices/040_01_mira_0aef7fe491ece093.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.04,
      "gain": 0.92
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 41,
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "text": "A thread to hold. Lightning to reveal. A beginning to connect them. Three gifts, finally moving as one.",
    "start": 410.2,
    "end": 415.80397916666664,
    "file": "voices/041_00_narrator_d95872237de0aa51.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.77,
      "speed": 1.03,
      "gain": 0.96
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 41,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "Again. Together this time.",
    "start": 417.135,
    "end": 418.74025,
    "file": "voices/041_01_kael_cbcfd96baa12639e.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 42,
    "speaker": "mira",
    "text": "Left shoulder down. Make it choose where to open.",
    "start": 420.2,
    "end": 422.7365208333333,
    "file": "voices/042_00_mira_a34b52aea3510a72.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.04,
      "gain": 0.92
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 42,
    "speaker": "riven",
    "text": "I see the gap. It is moving against the armour.",
    "start": 424.65,
    "end": 427.02866666666665,
    "file": "voices/042_01_riven_3a2c1ef65bfef8b7.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.91,
      "speed": 1.12,
      "gain": 0.98
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 43,
    "speaker": "riven",
    "text": "One to measure. One to follow. The third is yours!",
    "start": 430.2,
    "end": 432.65904166666667,
    "file": "voices/043_00_riven_38ead8b0e53626bc.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.91,
      "speed": 1.12,
      "gain": 0.98
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 43,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "I have it. Keep the current steady!",
    "start": 434.65,
    "end": 436.5575416666666,
    "file": "voices/043_01_kael_019a8ac5d3deecd0.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 44,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "It can avoid a strike. It cannot avoid a connection already holding it!",
    "start": 440.2,
    "end": 444.1349375,
    "file": "voices/044_00_kael_b938919963bcdc4d.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 44,
    "speaker": "mira",
    "text": "Riven, now! Through the thread!",
    "start": 445.317,
    "end": 446.7546458333333,
    "file": "voices/044_01_mira_0b5d63825cb2e58e.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.04,
      "gain": 0.92
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 45,
    "speaker": "riven",
    "text": "Your turn to be rescued, Ardyn!",
    "start": 450.2,
    "end": 451.9693541666667,
    "file": "voices/045_00_riven_030bf1f9e2a3e1a0.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.91,
      "speed": 1.12,
      "gain": 0.98
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 45,
    "speaker": "mira",
    "text": "The shell was only a lock. The real thing is coming through!",
    "start": 454.65,
    "end": 457.6699791666666,
    "file": "voices/045_01_mira_c65787cadcb1012e.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.04,
      "gain": 0.92
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 46,
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "The dais, Kael! Close its anchor, not its mouth!",
    "start": 460.2,
    "end": 463.0734166666667,
    "file": "voices/046_00_elder_434250f86b8a26a4.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.69,
      "speed": 0.98,
      "gain": 0.97
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 46,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "Mira, hold the line. Riven, everything you have left!",
    "start": 464.65,
    "end": 467.55910416666666,
    "file": "voices/046_01_kael_2a1348866d93a4e3.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 47,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "You came through a broken connection. Then that is where this ends!",
    "start": 470.2,
    "end": 473.45493749999997,
    "file": "voices/047_00_kael_ea93c6e3ab945217.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 47,
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "text": "The sky held. For one impossible moment, so did Kael.",
    "start": 474.954,
    "end": 478.1621666666667,
    "file": "voices/047_01_narrator_117a237ba2fdb9f8.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.77,
      "speed": 1.03,
      "gain": 0.96
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 48,
    "speaker": "mira",
    "text": "Kael, look at me. Tell me your name.",
    "start": 480.2,
    "end": 482.1206458333333,
    "file": "voices/048_00_mira_30c7441ccc7f550a.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.04,
      "gain": 0.92
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 48,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "Kael Ardyn. I think I know that much.",
    "start": 484.65,
    "end": 486.82160416666665,
    "file": "voices/048_01_kael_b870c93a0e164d8c.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 49,
    "speaker": "kael",
    "text": "My mother sang to me when storms came. I remember her hands, but the song is gone.",
    "start": 490.2,
    "end": 494.555125,
    "file": "voices/049_00_kael_d7e0abd0d08fec10.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.82,
      "speed": 1.06,
      "gain": 0.93
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 49,
    "speaker": "mira",
    "text": "I am sorry.",
    "start": 496.772,
    "end": 497.47295833333334,
    "file": "voices/049_01_mira_7bed5b1d690d9612.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 1.0,
      "speed": 1.04,
      "gain": 0.92
    }
  },
  {
    "shot": 50,
    "speaker": "riven",
    "text": "You saved people today. That does not make the price fair.",
    "start": 500.2,
    "end": 503.17552083333334,
    "file": "voices/050_00_riven_e2fe096d768c7468.wav",
    "source_voice": "MeloTTS EN_INDIA SID2",
    "profile": {
      "pitch": 0.91,
